#: ../../index.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Generate 1D and 2D barcodes in Python with pyStrich – Code 39, Code 128, "
"EAN-13, ITF-14, Data Matrix, QR Code, PDF417 and Aztec Code as PNG, SVG, "
"EPS, DXF and terminal art."
msgstr ""
"Générez des codes-barres 1D et 2D en Python avec pyStrich – Code 39, Code "
"128, EAN-13, ITF-14, Data Matrix, QR Code, PDF417 et Aztec Code en PNG, SVG,"
" EPS, DXF et rendu terminal."

#: ../../index.rst
msgid "pyStrich"
msgstr "pyStrich"

#: ../../index.rst
msgid ""
"pyStrich is a fast pure-Python module for generating 1D and 2D barcodes. It "
"supports Code 39, Code 128 (including GS1-128), EAN-13, ITF-14 (and "
"Interleaved 2 of 5), Data Matrix (including GS1 Data Matrix), QR Code, "
"PDF417 and Aztec Code symbologies. All eight emit PNG (via :class:`Pillow "
"<PIL.Image.Image>`), SVG and EPS. The 2D formats additionally render to "
"terminal art and DXF for direct part marking."
msgstr ""
"pyStrich est un module rapide, écrit intégralement en Python pour générer "
"des codes-barres 1D et 2D. Il prend en charge les symbologies Code 39, Code "
"128 (y compris GS1-128), EAN-13, ITF-14 (et 2 parmi 5 entrelacé), Data "
"Matrix (y compris GS1 Data Matrix), QR Code, PDF417 et Aztec Code. Les huit "
"produisent du PNG (via :class:`Pillow <PIL.Image.Image>`), du SVG et de "
"l'EPS. Les formats 2D offrent en plus un rendu terminal et le DXF pour le "
"marquage direct des pièces."

#: ../../index.rst
msgid "pyStrich is encoder-only -- it does not read barcodes."
msgstr "pyStrich est uniquement un encodeur : il ne lit pas les codes-barres."

